  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/CaixoBouPortalValenciaDimarts.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>50 fotos dels bous i vaques de dimarts, de la ramaderia &#39;El Mijares&#39;, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/DinarPensionistesPortalValenciaDimecres.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>del dinar de pensionistes oferit per la comissi&oacute; de festes del carrer del Portal de Val&egrave;ncia, a Onda, a la cova de l&#39;Algepsar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5230.jpg\" alt=\"img_5230\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5232.jpg\" alt=\"img_5232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5234.jpg\" alt=\"img_5234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5236.jpg\" alt=\"img_5236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5238.jpg\" alt=\"img_5238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5245.jpg\" alt=\"img_5245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5246.jpg\" alt=\"img_5246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portalvalencia17porrabousijubilats/img_5255.jpg\" alt=\"img_52